{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-types-pattern-matching","title":"代数类型与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/algebraic-types-pattern-matching","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"polymorphism-type-inference","title":"多态与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/polymorphism-type-inference","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"gadt-phantom-types","title":"GADT 与幻影类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/gadt-phantom-types","wordCount":1458,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"类型系统\">类型系统</h1><p>OCaml 的类型系统基于 Hindley-Milner 类型推断，但远超经典 ML 的范畴——它支持代数数据类型与完备模式匹配、参数多态与行多态、广义代数数据类型（GADT）与幻影类型。这些机制共同构成一个在编译期就能排除大量运行时错误的静态保障层。</p>\n<p>本章从三个递进维度展开：首先是代数类型与模式匹配这一 OCaml 编程的基石，然后是多态与类型推断机制的工作原理与边界，最后是 GADT 和幻影类型等高级类型编程技术。三篇文档覆盖从日常使用到类型级编程的完整谱系。</p>\n"}